    <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="section" dg:origin="1 240 1382 2310 2022">
      <dg:chunk dg:structure="header" dg:origin="1 240 1382 994 1428" dg:style="font-weight: bold; color: darkslategray">
        <dg:chunk dg:structure="lim" dg:origin="1 240 1382 279 1428">1.</dg:chunk> Financial Performance Narrative</dg:chunk>
      <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1492 2310 1534; 1 240 1555 2310 1597; 1 240 1617 2310 1659; 1 240 1680 773 1722">The third quarter of 2146 was marked by a steady increase in lease revenues from corporate scientific research contracts. Physical occupancy at Spire Beta (Scientific Leases) reached <dg:chunk dg:structure="span" xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="88" dg:origin="1 1683 1555 1778 1597">88%</dg:chunk>, while Spire Alpha (Luxury Penthouses) remained at <dg:chunk dg:structure="span" xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="64" dg:origin="1 719 1617 802 1659">64%</dg:chunk> occupancy. Both sectors remain in compliance with the covenants set forth in the Mezzanine Loan Agreement.</docset:OperationalNarrative>
      <docset:CovenantCompliance dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1792 2310 1834; 1 240 1855 2310 1897; 1 240 1917 2310 1959; 1 240 1980 585 2022" xml:id="covenantcompliance" dg:itemprop="references" dg:href="#covenantthreshold" dg:value="Occupancy Covenant Section 4.01(2) Document 2A">Specifically, we report that the weighted average occupancy exceeds the threshold of the Occupancy Covenant defined in Section 4.01(2) of the Mezzanine Loan Agreement (Document 2A), which mandates a scientific occupancy rate of not less than <docset:CovenantThreshold xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="72.5" dg:origin="1 1052 1917 1170 1959" xml:id="covenantthreshold">72.5%</docset:CovenantThreshold> (calculated via leased PVUs) and not less than <docset:CovenantThreshold xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="60.0" dg:origin="1 2124 1917 2242 1959">60.0%</docset:CovenantThreshold> for residential spaces.</docset:CovenantCompliance>
    </docset:OperationalNarrative>
